// Into flooded pumpworks by the service door on its east wall and up over the pump wheel (9 m), without wall
// climbing: from the gap between the wheel and the east wall, the rope gun's hook goes 15 m straight up into the
// iron gallery under the roof; the mole climbs above the wheel's top, swings west with A, lets go over the wheel
// and lands on its west shoulder, unhurt. On west it steps down onto the timber landing on the viewing window's
// sill and takes its rope ladder to the chest: `site_pumpworks_rope_to_chest.scn`.
map
